```bash
mkdir output
```

This implementation allows you to upload multiple PDF files and concatenates them into a single PDF file using the `pdfunite` command. The service listens on port `5000` and responds with the concatenated PDF file. The test case creates dummy PDF files for testing purposes and cleans them up afterward.

